# Cookie refresh DNA (all platforms)

When Tim provides new cookies for **any supported platform** (paste, file, or Cookie-Editor export), **always** follow this workflow. Never update cookies for only one script in isolation.

## Single command (preferred)

```bash
node scripts/integrate-cookies.js < cookies.json
# or: npm run cookies -- cookies.json
```

Auto-detects platform(s) from domains and runs the correct integrator(s). One paste can update Amazon + Bol + Sellerboard if domains span multiple services.

