## Amazon

1. **Route by domain** — `node scripts/integrate-amazon-cookies.js` or universal `integrate-cookies.js`.
2. Auto-detects marketplace: `amazon.com` / `sellercentral.amazon.com` → NA; `amazon.co.uk` / FR / IT / ES / NL / BE / PL / SE / IE / TR / EU portal → UK/EU bucket; `amazon.de` → DE; `amazon.ca` → CA; `advertising.amazon.*` → Ads; APAC (JP, AU, IN, SG, AE, SA) → UK/EU bucket.
3. **Always merge** — incoming cookies merge into existing raw files, then `convert-amazon-cookies.js` rebuilds `scripts/amazon-storage-state.json`.
4. Legacy `amazon-cookies-uk-raw.json` is read into the UK/EU bucket on merge; new UK pastes go to `amazon-cookies-raw.json`.

```bash
node scripts/integrate-amazon-cookies.js < cookies.json
# Manual merge only: node scripts/convert-amazon-cookies.js
```

## Bol

1. **Route bol.com cookies** — `node scripts/integrate-bol-cookies.js` or universal `integrate-cookies.js`.
2. Updates `bol-cookies-raw.json` and both `scripts/bol-storage-state.json` + `bol-storage-state.json`.

```bash
node scripts/integrate-bol-cookies.js < cookies.json
```

